3. PsychonautWiki API and wiki (planned inputs, no snapshot committed yet)

   The fetch command reads two services of PsychonautWiki. Their content is
   the PsychonautWiki content of point 2, under the same licenses.
   GraphQL API: https://api.psychonautwiki.org/ (substance data)
   Wiki API:    https://psychonautwiki.org/w/api.php (whether a page exists,
                its title and its last revision; no page text)
   A snapshot of their answers is not part of this repository yet. When one
   is added, its fetch date and the revision of every page are recorded in
   the snapshot itself. tests/fixtures/api/ holds a few recorded answers,
   trimmed, as test fixtures.

